seg-06c7d8d62b44 = <b>Geometry / redundancy</b> — pooling a second constellation's satellites tightens the single-fault HPL: more measurements and a larger single-SV (SV: space vehicle, that is a satellite) sub-solution set give a strictly smaller bound.

